        <p class="updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> <em>October 2nd, 2026</em></p>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Enjoying 😊</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Learning JavaScript.</li>
                <li>Coffee! ☕ Or maybe some <a href="https://advanced.gg/?ref=jiggy" target="_blank">ADVANCED</a>???</li>
                <li>Gaming... <em>(always!)</em></li>
                <li>Keeping our little homelab alive like a mad scientist!</li>
                <li>The fall weather slowly rolling in! 🍂</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Doing 🤔</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Live streaming gameplay and more over on <a href="https://twitch.tv/jiggyflyjoe" target="_blank">my Twitch channel</a>. I may be crazy, but I love sharing my love for gaming!</li>
                <li>Continuing my now years-long search for a job that won't kill me or my spirit. That <em>very</em> meager monthly Twitch payout ain't doin' much, folks!</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Reading 📖</h2>
