            <ul>
                <li><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/221144756-the-shades-of-orthea" target="_blank"><em>The Shades of Orthea</em></a> by my fellow streaming pal <a href="https://www.thatviolinchick.com/" target="_blank">Hannah Gordon.</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Watching 📺</h2>
            <p>Listen, I watch a lot of TV shows. Like <em>a lot</em> a lot. I'm a sucker for pretty much any series that keeps my interest. So, understand that I'm a little bit of a crazy person when it comes to shows that I'm watching. Currently, I'm tuned into:</p><br>
            <ul>
                <li>I've finally moved on to <em>Star Trek: The Next Generation</em> now that I've finished the original series, <em>The Animated Series</em>, and the original cast's six theatrical films for my big “epic rewatch” of all things <em>Trek</em>! I've been doing reviews over on <a href="https://blog.jiggyflyjoe.com" target="_blank">my blog</a>! If you're interested in reading those, feel free to subscribe to said blog!</li>
                <li>Now that it's spooky season, I'm thinking of rewatching one of my favorite <a href="https://mikeflanaganfilm.com/" target="_blank">Mike Flanagan</a> projects...</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Playing 🎮</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="https://palia.com" target="_blank"><em>Palia</a></em>. Because they are constantly doing monthly updates!</li>
                <li><a href="https://nomanssky.com" target="_blank"><em>No Man's Sky</em></a>. Their new COSMOS update coinciding with their 10th anniversary has sucked me back in!</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Making 🧶</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Web things, like my video series highlighting my playthrough of <a href="https://www.kojimaproductions.jp/en/death-stranding-dc" target="_blank"><em>Death Stranding</em></a> over on <a href="https://youtu.be/f5fGD0-VH_0" target="_blank">my YouTube channel!</a></li>
                <li>Digital things in my little video games.</li>
                <li><a href="https://twitch.tv/jiggyflyjoe" target="_blank">Live streams!</a></li>
